      "mentions": 22,
      "title": {
        "en": "Neat haircuts and fresh grooming results"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently compliment the quality of baths, styling, and nail trims, noting that dogs return home clean, fresh-smelling, and neatly groomed. Many pet owners appreciate the precise attention to breed-specific cuts, while others highlight the cute finishing touches like bows and bandanas."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 18,
      "title": {
        "en": "Patient and welcoming grooming staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently praise the friendly front desk team and groomers for their polite customer service, attentiveness, and patience with active or vocal pets. While the vast majority of clients report positive experiences with the staff, one owner felt the team was unable to accommodate a very large, stubborn dog."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for sensitive pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents often mention that groomers treat their dogs with genuine affection and patience, successfully soothing shy or nervous pets during nail trims and bath sessions. Owners describe feeling at ease leaving their animals, though one boarding customer reported skin irritation after a kennel stay."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can groomers accommodate shy or nervous dogs?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients frequently note that the staff is gentle, calm, and patient with anxious or shy pets."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Dog Grooming USA offer boarding alongside grooming?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, pet owners mention using both day grooming services and pet hotel boarding facilities."
